格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"team-task for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): long-horizon multi-agent tasks — reviewed plan DAG, runtime-owned settlement, event-log truth, resident reconciler","id":"gh:1336677667","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-team-task","slug":"Ready22Race/dsh-team-task","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","multi-agent"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"team-task for DeepSeek Harness (dsh): long-horizon multi-agent tasks — reviewed plan DAG, runtime-ow"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ned settlement, event-log truth, resident reconciler"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# team-task — long-horizon multi-agent tasks for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness (dsh)\nplugin: a **lead** session plans a reviewed DAG, durable **members** execut"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"e\nits nodes, and a resident reconciler keeps the task moving — across model\nfailures, interrupted tu"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"rns, and harness restarts."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Built for goals that take hours, not turns."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Why"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Team plugins optimized for short bursts fail on long tasks in predictable\nways. team-task's answers,"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ptimized for short bursts fail on long tasks in predictable\nways. team-task's answers, in one table:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| Long-task failure | team-task answer |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| A member finishes but never calls the completion tool | **Runtime-owned settlement**: the run sett"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"les at its idle edge regardless; tools accelerate, never gate |\n| The lead session goes offline mid-"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"task | **Resident reconciler** re-kicks every task on a timer; work resumes the moment the lead retu"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"rns |\n| An early hallucination poisons downstream work | **Review gate**: only lead `approve` unlock"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"s dependents; `rework` sends feedback back to the *same node*, attempts are first-class history |\n| "},{"id":"p8s6","text":"A reassigned worker writes a late result | **Fence tokens** on an append-only event log; stale fence"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"s are rejected at the log, not by etiquette |\n| Crashed process, lost wake-ups, stranded messages | "},{"id":"p8s8","text":"The event log is the only truth; delivery is the scheduler's job and is retried at every kick |\n| Pr"},{"id":"p8s9","text":"otocol prompt tax in every request | **Progressive playbooks**: ~8-line resident trigger; lead/membe"},{"id":"p8s10","text":"r protocols load on demand via `team_task_playbook` |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Full rationale, axioms, state machine, and the event-log-native board design:\ndocs/design.md."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Prerequisites: Node `^22.19 || >=24` (Node 23 fails to boot dsh)."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**1. Install dsh** (skip if you have it):"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**2. Add the plugin** — pick one:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**3. Verify the composition** (expect an `id: team-task` row):"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**4. Start dsh** (a restart is required after `plugin add` — the bundle\nlist is cached in-process):"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"**5. First run** — open http://127.0.0.1:3080, set a model key\n(Settings → Models) and pick a worksp"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"* — open http://127.0.0.1:3080, set a model key\n(Settings → Models) and pick a workspace, then send:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"> 用 team-task 跑一个长任务：先加载 lead playbook，规划一张带依赖和\n> 预指派（assignee）的节点图，逐节点评审，最后合并交付。"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"You should see: a task card in the conversation, the board floater on the\nright (segments / filters "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"/ node cards / inspector), and\n`<workspace>/.team-task/tasks/<id>/log.jsonl` on disk. Pre-assigned n"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"odes\nauto-flow when their dependencies approve; everything else waits for your\nexplicit dispatch or "},{"id":"p22s4","text":"to-flow when their dependencies approve; everything else waits for your\nexplicit dispatch or review."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Tools"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Tool | Who | What |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| `team_task_playbook` | anyone | Load the lead / member / recovery protocol on demand |\n| `team_tas"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"k_create` | lead | Create the task (+ optional initial plan DAG) |\n| `team_task_add_member` | lead |"},{"id":"p25s3","text":" Spawn a durable member with a **role profile** (provider/model/effort/playbook; omitted fields inhe"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"rit the lead's route) |\n| `team_task_plan` | lead | Add / update / cancel plan nodes |\n| `team_task_"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"dispatch` | lead | Dispatch a node (fence++), to a member, the shared pool, or the lead itself |\n| `"},{"id":"p25s6","text":"team_task_await` | lead | Block until review work exists or all nodes settle — instead of polling |\n"},{"id":"p25s7","text":"| `team_task_complete` | assignee | Claim completion with the current fence + a self-contained outpu"},{"id":"p25s8","text":"t |\n| `team_task_review` | lead | `approve` (unlocks dependents) or `rework` (feedback required, car"},{"id":"p25s9","text":"ried into the next attempt) |\n| `team_task_send` | anyone | Durable message to lead or teammate; sch"},{"id":"p25s10","text":"eduler delivers |\n| `team_task_status` | anyone | Snapshot: nodes, runs, fences, member activity, at"},{"id":"p25s11","text":"tention list, your inbox |\n| `team_task_finish` | lead | Close and archive (full event history and e"},{"id":"p25s12","text":"very run retained) |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Storage"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"`log.jsonl` is the single source of truth; every surface (tools, board\nroutes, offline verify) folds"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" the same events, and any historical \"team\nsituation at time T\" is a replay of the log prefix. `snap"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"shot.json` and\n`inbox/` are write-through **derived views** for humans — safe to read,\nnever written"},{"id":"p28s4","text":" by hand, and never read back by the code."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"### Releasing (maintainers)"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"The repo commits `lib/` so `github:` installs need no build step — always\npublish from a clean `pnpm"},{"id":"p34s2","text":" build` (the css-module hashes are repo-relative,\nso the output is machine-independent)."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"With 2FA enabled, `npm publish` alone returns 403 — pass `--otp`, or create\na granular access token "},{"id":"p36s2","text":"with \"bypass 2FA\" scoped to this package and put it\nin `~/.npmrc` for tokenized publishes. After pub"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"lishing, tag the release:"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Status & roadmap"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"- **M1 (this release)** — host plugin end-to-end: tools, event log, fences,\nscheduler + reconciler, "},{"id":"p39s2","text":"runtime settlement, review/rework, playbooks, board\ndata routes (`/plugins/team-task/state`, `/plugi"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"ns/team-task/log`).\n- **M2** — the event-log-native board UI (kanban lanes + DAG overlay +\nattention"},{"id":"p39s4","text":" strip + per-node run timeline + replay slider; design.md §6).\n- **M3** — consumption-acked delivery"},{"id":"p39s5","text":" and parentless member wake (needs\nupstream seams; tracked in design.md §7), npm publish, per-run co"},{"id":"p39s6","text":"s member wake (needs\nupstream seams; tracked in design.md §7), npm publish, per-run cost\naccounting."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"Known limits (v0.1): member wake-ups still require the live lead Agent (an\nupstream `followup` const"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"raint — the reconciler resumes work when the lead\nreturns); `message_delivered` marks inbox acceptan"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"ce, not turn consumption."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## 中文速览"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"team-task 是面向**长任务**的 dsh 多智能体插件：lead 规划一张**需评审的\nDAG**，durable member 执行节点，常驻 reconciler 保证崩溃/重启后任务继"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"am-task 是面向**长任务**的 dsh 多智能体插件：lead 规划一张**需评审的\nDAG**，durable member 执行节点，常驻 reconciler 保证崩溃/重启后任务继续。"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
